Meta.documentation:mime
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Content-type answer for a name. mime:png answers "image/png". Given bytes
Meta.documentation:through the octetstream interface, magic bytes decide instead. Nothing
Meta.documentation:found -> "binary/<ext>".
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:mime:png>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:image/png
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port out_String - the mime string
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_$all - bytes to sniff (magic bytes beat the extension)
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental
